meta {
  name: Admin
  seq: 22
}

docs {
  Platform-admin API for the referral program, plus the admin audit log.

  ## Access

  - The token must belong to a platform admin: `php artisan admin:grant you@example.com`.
  - That account needs two-factor authentication confirmed (skippable locally
    with `PLATFORM_ADMIN_REQUIRE_2FA=false`), so log in via `Auth/Login` then
    `Auth/2FA - Verify`.
  - With `PLATFORM_ADMIN_API_ENABLED=false` every request here answers 404 —
    use the `referrals:*` and `admin:*` artisan commands instead.

  Every change is written to the audit log (`Audit Log - List`).

  ## Variables

  List requests store the first row's id so the rest of the folder works:
  `referralProgramId`, `referralRuleId`, `referralCodeId`, `referralId`,
  `referralRewardId`, `blockedDomainId`. `Rewards - Grant Manual` needs
  `userId` set by hand (a user's id, e.g. from `Referrals - List Admin`).
}
